# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SAIN MOTORS — MEGA TEST DRIVE 6
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values. Never commit .env.local
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Google Apps Script Web App URL — the /exec URL you get after deploying
# docs/apps-script.gs from the registrations spreadsheet.
# Handles POST (append registration). Nothing is read back at render time.
#
# Edition 6 needs the REWRITTEN script published as a new version: it stores a
# visit-date column, and it enforces NO capacity limit. Edition 5's script caps
# every time at 40 and answers "full" beyond it, so leaving it deployed keeps
# refusing people for a limit that no longer exists. See the migration section in
# README.md.
#
# While this points at the live sheet, submitting the form in development writes
# a real row to it.
#
# Treat it as a SECRET: it accepts writes, so anyone holding it can add rows to
# the sheet. Never paste the real value into this file — this one is committed.
# It belongs in .env.local locally, and in the host's environment variables in
# production. Never prefixed with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
#
# Shape: https://script.google.com/macros/s/<deployment-id>/exec
GOOGLE_SHEETS_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Canonical site origin, used for metadata / Open Graph absolute URLs.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://megatestdrive.sainmotors.mn
